                        <p class="mod-desc">An enchantment that lets you vein-mine ores in one hit. Completely optional to use.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mod-card">
                        <div class="mod-card-top">
                            <img class="mod-icon" src="https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cqIcXVf5/0e1b2779d8be6a1010e74f71cd8cd4a3b91095a.png" alt="Magnetic mod icon" loading="lazy">
                            <a class="mod-name mod-link" href="https://modrinth.com/datapack/magnetic-enchantment" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Magnetic</a>
                            <span class="mod-badge badge--optional">Optional</span>
