                <p class="section-subtitle">View the world in real-time — may take a moment to load.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://map.tsnsmp.online" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="open-new-tab-btn">Open map in new tab ↗</a>
            <div class="map-frame">
                <div class="map-container">
